WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.181
Lesson 1: How case interviews work

2
00:00:03.331 --> 00:00:09.252
What a case interview is, the two formats you will meet, and the six things every interviewer scores.

3
00:00:09.502 --> 00:00:10.975
Three things to remember.

4
00:00:10.995 --> 00:00:14.922
Nobody expects you to know the answer; they want to watch you think.

5
00:00:15.122 --> 00:00:19.724
You are judged on solving the case and on how you come across while you do it.

6
00:00:19.924 --> 00:00:24.322
Six stages get scored. Practise all six, not just structuring.

7
00:00:24.522 --> 00:00:29.261
The full lesson has a worked example, an exercise, and a quick quiz.
